hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1803","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aasmaan ki taraf uthaya gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Main nehar par aaya jiskay donon kinarey khaali moti key gumbad they. To main ne kaha: Ye kya hai ae Jibreel? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Kausar hai. (Bukhari: 4964)"
"1804","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, aur un se Allah Taala key qaul (Beshak ham ne tumhey Kausar ata kya) key baarey mein poochha gaya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Nehar hai jo tumhaarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di gai hai. Uskay donon kinarey us par khaali moti hain. Uskay bartan sitaaron ki ginti jaisey hain. (Bukhari: 4965)"
